21:["$","p",null,{"children":"After making changes to your workflow, you can save your progress by clicking the ‘Save’ button at the top of the screen. This ensures all your edits are stored, so you don’t lose any work."}]
22:["$","p",null,{"children":"If you forget to save your changes and try to leave the page or navigate away, appse ai will prompt you with a pop-up asking if you want to save the changes or leave without saving. This gives you a chance to confirm and save your work before exiting."}]
23:["$","p",null,{"children":"This feature ensures you don’t lose any progress on your workflow!"}]
