2b:["$","p",null,{"children":"The Inactive/Active toggle is used to activate or deactivate your workflow. Clicking the toggle will switch it to Active, which means your workflow will begin continuously syncing data as per the defined triggers or schedules. Once activated, you can toggle it back to Inactive at any time to stop the automation."}]
