44:["$","p",null,{"children":["The ",["$","strong",null,{"children":"Click to Start"}]," area encourages users to begin creating their workflow by adding a node. When you click on the ",["$","strong",null,{"children":"plus icon"}]," in the center of the canvas, it takes you to a ",["$","strong",null,{"children":"selection screen"}]," where you can choose the first node to start building your automation. This is the first step in designing your workflow, where you’ll define how your automation begins and set the foundation for the entire process."]}]
