48:["$","p",null,{"children":["The ",["$","strong",null,{"children":"Undo"}]," button allows you to quickly ",["$","strong",null,{"children":"reverse"}]," your most recent action. If you make a mistake or want to try a different approach, simply click ",["$","strong",null,{"children":"Undo"}]," to revert to the previous step. This is a handy tool for experimenting with your workflow without the worry of permanent changes."]}]
