51:["$","p",null,{"children":["The ",["$","strong",null,{"children":"Zoom Out"}]," button allows you to ",["$","strong",null,{"children":"decrease the canvas view by 5%"}]," each time you click it. This helps you get a broader view of your workflow, making it easier to see the entire canvas and how different nodes connect. You can click it multiple times to zoom out progressively as needed."]}]
