57:["$","p",null,{"children":["The ",["$","strong",null,{"children":"Tidy Up"}]," button automatically ",["$","strong",null,{"children":"arranges and aligns"}]," the nodes on the canvas in a clean, organized layout. It ensures that your workflow is visually neat, with consistent spacing between nodes and a structured flow, making it easier to read and manage."]}]
